      "observed": "We observed that a 2 kg load lifted 1 m needed about 20 N of force, giving F x d = 20 J, and that holding the load still or carrying it sideways involved no distance in the direction of the force. For the bucket in the Kitui well, 200 N x 2 m, 4 m, 6 m and 8 m gave 400 J, 800 J, 1200 J and 1600 J, matching the PE table.",
